            "calc": {
                "before_use": "<p><strong>Tips for COVID-19: </strong>Use after diagnosis to determine dispo.&nbsp;Inputs line up better with known COVID-19 risk factors; adjust for elderly.</p>",
                "calc_type": "calculator",
                "chief_complaint_en": [
                    "Cough",
                    "Fever"
                ],
                "cmeEndDate": "2025-07-25 00:00:00+00+122",
                "cmeLastReviewed": "2022-07-25 00:00:00+00+122",
                "cmeReleaseDate": "2020-10-08 00:00:00+00+00",
                "cmeVersion": "33.1",
                "content": {
                    "about": {
                        "evidence_based_medicine_en": "<p>The original study created a five-tier risk stratification based on 14199 inpatients with community acquired pneumonia. This was then validated on 38039 inpatients and additionally another 2287 inpatients and outpatients. Points are assigned based on age, co-morbid disease, abnormal physical findings, and abnormal laboratory results.</p>\n<p>In comparison to the PSI score, <calculator id=\"324\">CURB-65</calculator> offers equal sensitivity of mortality prediction due to community acquired pneumonia. Notably, CURB-65 (74.6%) has a higher specificity than PSI (52.2%). However, CURB-65 had a lower sensitivity than PSI in predicting ICU admission.</p>",
                        "formula_en": "<p>Addition of selected points, as above.</p>",
                        "more_info_en": "<p><strong>Score interpretation:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Risk Class</th>\n<th>Risk</th>\n<th>Point Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>None from Comorbidities, PE findings, or Lab findings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II</td>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>&le;70 points</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>71-90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>Moderate</td>\n<td>91-130</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>High</td>\n<td>&gt;130 total points</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>",
                        "references_list": {
                            "Clinical Practice Guidelines": [],
                            "Manufacturer Website": [],
                            "Original/Primary Reference": [
                                {
                                    "href": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?cmd=retrieve&db=pubmed&list_uids=8995086&dopt=Abstract",
                                    "text": "Fine MJ. et. al. A prediction rule to identify low-risk patients with community-acquired pneumonia. N Engl J Med. 1997 Jan 23;336(4):243-50."
                                }
                            ],
                            "Other References": [
