                                    "text": "Anurag A, Preetam M. Validation of PSI/PORT, CURB-65 and SCAP scoring system in COVID-19 pneumonia for prediction of disease severity and 14-day mortality. Clin Respir J. 2021;15(5):467-471."
                                }
