                        "answer": "<p>MDCalc&rsquo;s Continuing Medical Education (CME) service allows users to easily earn AMA PRA Category 1 Credits<sup>TM</sup> through regular use of MDCalc. Simply put, on top of getting the best medical calculators in the world, your usage will help you achieve your annual CME requirements, including specialty CME, without any extra effort.</p>",
